@startuml
state Homepage {
  [*] --> Homepage
}
state ProjectView
state CareerView
state ProjectInfo
state Photos
state Videos
state CareerInfo
state Updates
state ApplicationForm

Homepage -> ProjectView : select projects
Homepage -> CareerView : select careers

ProjectView -> ProjectInfo : select project

ProjectInfo -> Photos : choose photos
ProjectInfo -> Videos : choose videos

CareerView -> CareerInfo : select career

CareerInfo -> Updates : view updates
CareerInfo -> ApplicationForm : open application form

ApplicationForm --> Homepage : submit application
@enduml
